r-term wear evidence.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Repeat three strokes at load 0.10 and review actual outcomes.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"One low-load stroke moved a measured small amount of soil without observed cracking.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"berry-propagation\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can seeds from my gathered berries establish an additional shared food plant at a suitable site?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"The available propagation contract requires four rounds of personal study, extraction from an owned whole berry, and sowing on a suitable inspected open-soil site.\\\",\\\"I currently own four whole berries harvested at tick 65.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Seed viability, a suitable uncrowded site, emergence and future fruit production are untested.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Test propagation without sacrificing the immediate known-safe food reserve.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Read the propagation contract.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Personal mastery, extracted seeds, inspected suitable site and actual sowing.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Learn propagate-from-seed, then review supplies before extraction and site selection.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Potential future shared food supply; no planting or growth benefit has yet been observed.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"fddc7af8-5728-419a-bb8b-20bdade7289f","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"bounded_decision","description":null,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["queries","result_json"],"properties":{"queries":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["section","search","ids","offset","part"],"properties":{"section":{"